      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yermo%2C_California",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Yermo is known as the 'Gateway to the Calicos,' located just south of the Calico Mountains and historic Calico Ghost Town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
